      "prologue": "In June 1919, European leaders gathered in the glittering Hall of Mirrors at Versailles to dictate peace terms to a defeated Germany. Blamed entirely for the catastrophe under Article 231, Germany was forced to sign away land and pay £6.6 billion in reparations. Did Versailles resolve the conflicts of 1914, or create 1939?",
